WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.801
ERP Product Platform:

2
00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:04.055
a marketing site of a hundred and

3
00:00:04.055 --> 00:00:06.719
twenty-one pages for a product company.

4
00:00:06.719 --> 00:00:09.247
I led it from architecture to deploy.

5
00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:13.854
Content lives in a hundred and thirty-eight JSON files,

6
00:00:13.854 --> 00:00:17.237
so adding a page never means changing a component.

7
00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:21.157
Every build runs a chain of checks,

8
00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:25.477
and an SEO lint stops any weak page from shipping.

9
00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:29.485
In production the security headers were missing,

10
00:00:29.485 --> 00:00:33.124
because the server that served the pages never ran Node.

11
00:00:33.124 --> 00:00:36.177
I moved them into the Apache and Nginx configs,

12
00:00:36.177 --> 00:00:38.127
and proved each one with curl.

13
00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:42.545
Production security findings went from ten to zero,

14
00:00:42.545 --> 00:00:47.985
and the SVG assets shrank from a hundred and forty-six megabytes to under nine.

15
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.108
The full case study is on my site.

